to_extras\":[],\"previews\":[],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"unicorn\":false,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"date_unix\":1762095600,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Wonderful, Weird, Woeful: Womxn Front \\u0026 Centre\\n\\nAre You Seeing This are back (already bby!) at our lush new home, LNZRT Studios, where we’ll have our usual stand-out curated short films from emerging filmmakers. ‘Wonderful, Weird, Woeful' is putting the womxn - in all their messy hilarious glory - front and centre, believe us when we say you don't wanna miss it...\\n\\nWe’ve got films, a filmmakers roundtable, time for audience questions, and a chance to grab a pint and chat/network afterwards.\\n\\nAYST is run by an award-winning documentary filmmaker, championing new filmmaking: submit your film via their website or email.\\n\\nDoors - 15:00\\n\\nLusthouse - Neeraja Raj\\n\\nChicken Girl - Em Humble\\n\\nNw if not :) - Felicitas Fuchs\\n\\nSmooch - Hayley Muirhead\\n\\nSpare Part - Ada Player and Bron Waugh\\n\\nPeriod Party - Georgia Brogan\\n\\nHopes and Beans - Klara Kaliger\\n\\nROUNDTABLE TALK\\n\\nTime for networking / hanging out\\n\\nWe always have free and cheaper spots for those who need, so drop us a DM or email us and we’ll sort you out.\\n\\nCW: eating disorders (Period Party)\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"69e80567daaaa992:5\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Are You Seeing This.\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1758531600,\"streaming_options\":null,\"id\":\"68d164b464a0270001fbc487\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"245\",\"name\":\"LNZRT\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-03-12/1814e171-32d9-4237-848d-85f91f0af396.jpg\"