Adapted from the critically acclaimed off-Broadway rock theatre hit, \\\"Hedwig and the Angry Inch\\\" tells the story of the \\\"internationally ignored\\\" rock singer, Hedwig, and her search for stardom and love.\\n\\nVenue: Signature Brew, Unit 15 Blackhorse Lane, London E17 5QJ\\n\\nDoors: Open 7pm, Film 7.45pm, Close 11.00pm\\n\\nRefreshments: Alcoholic, non-alcoholic drinks and food will be available. We will also be serving freshly made popcorn.\",\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"shopping_cart_enabled\":false,\"impression_id\":\"69e80567daaaa992:15\",\"offers_extras\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Signature Brew.\",\"announcement_date_unix\":1758191400,\"streaming_options\":null,\"id\":\"68cbdc2ab2c2250001dce80b\",\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"3591\",\"name\":\"Signature Brew\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2022-07-19/cf9f0866-c543-4008-8b08-026157cfb350.jpg\"},\"perm_name\":\"signature-brew-3m2g\",\"profile_active\":true},\"name\":\"Stow Film Lounge - Hedwig and the Angry Inch\",\"new\":false,\"faqs\":[],\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/bb9c4087a895?dice_id=bb9c4087a895\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/M548c981fa2b?dice_id=M548c981fa2b\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/o5f2c0dab291?dice_id=o5f2c0dab291\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/na48da62a11e?dice_id=na48da62a11e\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qdc277511276?dice_id=Qdc277511276\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/R8e3e6ea921e?dice_id=R8e3e6ea921e\"},\"score\":0,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2025-09-18T11:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2025-11-27T19:00:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2025-09-18T11:30:00+01:00\",\"event_start_d