<path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 17.5a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0Zm0 0V10m9 4.5a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0Zm0 0V7m-9 3V7.5l9-3V7m-9 3 9-3\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Discover the best nights out in your city, with tailored recommendations synced to your music library.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 18.5c-3.545-3-6.5-5.4-6.5-8.4 0-1.988 1.587-3.6 3.545-3.6 1.234 0 2.32.64 2.955 1.61a3.529 3.529 0 0 1 2.954-1.61c1.959 0 3.546 1.612 3.546 3.6 0 3-2.954 5.4-6.5 8.4Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Keep track of what’s coming up by saving events, sharing them with friends, or even listening to new music in the app.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17.5 19.5v.5h.5v-.5h-.5Zm-11-15V4H6v.5h.5Zm0 15H6v.5h.5v-.5Zm2-8.5H9v-1h-.5v1Zm9.5.5V11h-1v.5h1Zm-8.45-7 .49-.1-.081-.4H9.55v.5Zm0 15v.5h.409l.081-.4-.49-.1Zm4.9 0-.49.1.081.4h.409v-.5Zm4.05-15h.5V4h-.5v.5Zm-4-.5H14v1h.5V4ZM18 8.5V9h1v-.5h-1Zm-3.854-.354-.353.354.707.707.354-.353-.708-.708ZM11 6.292l.2-.458-.2.458ZM6 4.5v6h1v-6H6Zm0 6v9h1v-9H6Zm.5.5h2v-1h-2v1Zm3.05-7H6.5v1h3.05V4Zm.49 15.6A2 2 0 0 1 12 18v-1a3 3 0 0 0-2.94 2.4l.98.2ZM6.5 20h3.05v-1H6.5v1Zm5.5-2a2 2 0 0 1 1.96 1.6l.98-.2A3 3 0 0 0 12 17v1Zm2.45 2h3.05v-1h-3.05v1ZM18.5 4h-4v1h4V4Zm-.5.5v4h1v-4h-1Zm.146-.354-4 4 .708.708 4-4-.708-.708ZM12 6c-.285 0-.556-.06-.8-.166l-.4.916c.368.161.774.25 1.2.25V6Zm-.8-.166A2.005 2.005 0 0 1 10.04 4.4l-.98.198A3.004 3.004 0 0 0 10.8 6.75l.4-.916ZM18 19.5v-8h-1v8h1Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">We’ve made it easy to swap your ticket with a friend, or get a refund to a sold-out show. No stress.</p></div></div><div class=\"DownloadTheAppButtons__Buttons-sc-7487b594-0 ezoNRz\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/app/id898358948\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX gvlyjj\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15.91 2s-1.794.008-3.082 1.566h.001c-1.147 1.386-.855 2.572-.855 2.572s1.556.248 2.922-1.26C16.176 3.466 15.91 2 15.91 2Zm-2.745 4.88c-.422.156-.768.284-1.028.284-.324 0-.715-.138-1.169-.298-.63-.222-1.38-.487-2.243-.487C6.439 6.379 4 8.255 4 11.835 4 15.474 6.879 20 9.16 20c.354 0 .793-.146 1.28-.308.606-.2 1.286-.427 1.969-.427.611 0 1.142.182 1.666.362.51.175 1.014.347 1.58.347 2.496 0 4.345-4.772 4.345-4.772s-2.643-.94-2.643-3.662c0-2.416 2.122-3.412 2.122-3.412s-1.086-1.8-3.846-1.8c-.975 0-1.813.31-2.468.552Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>iOS</span></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fm.dice\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Fmxp7bk-dusk-til-dawn-all-night-vampire-takeover-31st-oct-artotel-london-hoxton-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Dusk 'til Dawn All Night Vampire Takeover\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-31T17:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-01T06:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"art'otel London Hoxton\",\"address\":\"1-3 Rivington Street, Hackney, London, EC2A 3DT, United Kingdom\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.52617,\"longitude\":-0.08326}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-06\\u002F5679cf79-a2e7-4d5e-b435-c26389140c1d.jpg?rect=944%2C0%2C5652%2C5652\"],\"description\":\"This Halloween, art’otel London Hoxton is set to host its first-ever all-night cinematic experience…\\n\\nFrom sundown on Halloween until sunrise on All Saints’ Day, the design-led hotel will transform its in-house cinema into a gothic hideaway for a 14-hour marathon of cult and classic vampire films — culminating, fittingly, with From Dusk Till Dawn as daylight breaks.\\n\\nThe curated line-up features Interview with the Vampire, The Lost Boys and From Dusk Till Dawn, with more titles to be revealed.\\n\\nFuel your night with a gloriously gory Kraken Rum “blood bag” cocktail, followed by a garlic-inspired feast fit for creatures of the night — with a selection of Brush Burger sliders, hearty Butternut Squash Curry boxes, and All-Garlic Flat Breads to help ward off evil spirits. A midnight feast of popcorn chicken with garlic dip and Korean glazed cauliflower will follow, with unlimited popcorn and pick’n’mix available throughout the night. Dawn survivors can enjoy breakfast and a bloody mary – a fitting reward for making it to sunrise.\\n\\nTickets are priced at £25 (with discounted options for hotel guests) and include 5 films, dinner, snacks and a welcome drink.\\n\\nTerms and conditions apply. 18+, UK only. The art’otel Dusk ‘til Dawn Vampire Movie Screening will be open for one night only from 5pm on 31st October to 6.30am on 1st November. Tickets are limited. Ticket price includes one welcome drink, an array of snacks, and 5 films. Customers will be responsible for their own travel.\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"art’otel\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc