0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p><p class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__NoSmartphone-sc-7130cefd-0 dbVqMc\">No smartphone? No worries, check our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/articles/19414143889169-How-to-access-your-tickets-if-you-can-t-get-on-the-app\">FAQs</a></p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002F2wb6b7-the-rocky-horror-picture-show-movie-night-31st-oct-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"The Rocky Horror Picture Show Movie Night\",\"startDate\":\"2025-10-31T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-10-31T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.4629923,\"longitude\":-0.169368800000029}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-08-21\\u002Ff811cefc-f514-4626-9f87-f6adbf12aad9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"],\"description\":\"**It’s nearly time to do The Time Warp… again! Our Rocky Horror Movie Night is back and on actual Halloween too 🎃 Celebrate 50 years of this iconic film with us this October!**\\n\\n**DOORS: 6PM \\u002F LIVE SHOW & MOVIE FROM 7PM \\u002F LAST ENTRY 8PM**\\n\\n**Over 70% sold out! Grab final release tickets for £25 now.**\\n\\nCome give yourself over to maximum pleasure… 🫦\\n\\nDust off those corsets and pink rubber gloves. Grab your emergency supply of Newspapers, loo roll, confetti, water pistols and toast and get your sweet transvestite arses down to the biggest & best Rocky Horror Picture Show screening in London, UK, hell THE WORLD 🌏\\n\\nSing-A-Long to the movie on a massive 25ft screen 📺  \\nYour Frank-N-Furter host - Drag Star Miss Leigh Ding! 👠  \\nOur Dreamteam showteam 🕺  \\nThe Sweetest Transvestite costume comp & Damn It Janet dance-offs ☠️  \\nCamp cocktails 🍹  \\nFrank N Furter hotdogs & nachos (Vegan goodness too!) 🌭  \\nOooky-spooky decor 🏚️  \\nPopcorn ONLY £3 🍿  \\n& The Time Warp. Again & Again & Again! 🕺💃\\n\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie.\\n\\nYour ticket includes entry to The Grand’s Halloween Party, too! Please note that last entry is 8pm and there is no re-entry between events.\\n\\nFor any ticketing enquiries, please contact DICE’s Help Centre. Please note, all our Movie Nights are 18+.\\n\\nFor any show \\u002F venue info, please contact info@claphamgrand.com\\n\\nFor any accessibility requirements \\u002F tickets, please contact access@claphamgrand.com\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Careers</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/diversity-equity-inclusion\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Diversity, equity \n&amp; inclusion</a></div></nav></details><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Fan Support<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5