 class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__TrackTitle-sc-2c0d3cc1-4 ccdrAW\">D&#x27;Angelo - Brown Sugar</div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAWrapper-sc-2c0d3cc1-0 cnZzuM\"><audio preload=\"none\"><source src=\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview122/v4/82/3e/3e/823e3ec2-0bbf-9b39-60d1-6f0997c0c1b6/mzaf_6783992627219921306.plus.aac.p.m4a\"/></audio><button class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAButton-sc-2c0d3cc1-2 kmEjJP ccUWLm eBjzPC\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 6 19 12 8.5 18V6Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__Content-sc-e27c8822-3 iLVFSu\"><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Container-sc-cac69206-5 jisTAL\"><h1 class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Title-sc-cac69206-0 duXLSp\">D&#x27;ANGELO LIVE 2015</h1><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Venues-sc-cac69206-1 iqTKlf\"><span>The Ivy House</span></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Date-sc-cac69206-2 kDgXil\">Sun, 2 Nov, 7:30 pm</div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tags-sc-cac69206-4 cfoWLz\"><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"m13.5 19.5-8-8v-6h6l8 8-6 6Z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M9 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3Z\"></path></svg><span>Film</span></span><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://w