" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 6 19 12 8.5 18V6Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Container-sc-d4710a3f-2 gzFXyG\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Text-sc-d4710a3f-1 ddUaYB\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Wrapper-sc-30f4de94-0 cEPNdr\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Truncated-sc-30f4de94-2 iyvFjU\"><p>D’Angelo disappears for fourteen years. Then, one night, he reemerges in a haze of light, sweat, and feedback — alive, possessed, transcendent. Live at the Vanguard captures that return: a body in rhythm, a band locked in telepathic groove, a crowd on the...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__MoreButton-sc-30f4de94-1 lbefHP\">Read more</button></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlights-sc-d40475af-2 dXmIOz\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.5 10.5H12v5m-1.5 0H12m0 0h1.5m-1.5-7V8m7.5 4a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0Z\"></path></svg><div><span>This is an 18+ event</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 14.5h-3v-5h5m-2 5v4m0-4h2m0 0 7 4v-13l-7 4m0 5v-5m9 1v3\"></path></svg><div><span>Presented by Deeper Into Movies.</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 EventDetailsBase__RefundPolicyHighlight-sc-d40475af-1 dVKeAb hDpyKl\"><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__CurrencyIconWrapper-sc-d4710a