:\\\"54d8a87238fe5d27d500988a\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"},\\\"perm_name\\\":\\\"multi-story-av292\\\",\\\"accessibility\\\":{\\\"url\\\":null},\\\"profile_active\\\":true,\\\"highlights\\\":[],\\\"space_name\\\":null,\\\"doors_open_date\\\":\\\"2025-11-06T18:00:00+00:00\\\",\\\"doors_close_date\\\":null}],\\\"secondary_status\\\":null,\\\"attendance_type\\\":\\\"live_only\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"on-sale\\\",\\\"previews\\\":[],\\\"tags_types\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"culture:film\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Film\\\"}],\\\"acquisition_type\\\":\\\"purchase\\\",\\\"about\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"My Eyes! My Eyes! brings their signature strangeness to MULTI STORY with Ebony \\u0026 Ivory – a new surreal and hilarious comedy from Jim Hosking, director of The Greasy Strangler and An Evening with Beverly Luff Linn.\\\\n\\\\nTwo musical legends gather at a Scottish cottage on the Mull of Kintyre for a tense summit to discuss a potential collaboration that will ultimately result in a global Number One smash hit single.\\\\n\\\\nJoin us for the screening, followed by a live Q\\u0026A with Jim Hosking and ‘Oinker’ Texas Joe, plus a DJ set from Texas Radio and the Big Beat.\\\\n\\\\nTicket price includes a raffle ticket.\\\\n\\\\nWritten and Directed by: Jim Hosking\\\\n\\\\nProduced by: Denzil Monk, Ant Timpson, Jim Hosking, Thelonious Brooks\\\\n\\\\nStarring: Sky Elobar and Gil Gex\\\\n\\\\nDirector of Photography: Marten Tedin\\\\n\\\\nComposer: Andrew Hung\\\\n\\\\nProduction Design: Felicity Hickson\\\\n\\\\nPresented in collaboration with My Eyes! My Eyes! – keeping Southwark weird through regular screenings of the wild, weird and wonderful.\\\",\\\"highlights\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"age_restriction\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"This is an 18+ event.\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"promoter\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Presented by MULTI STORY.\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"external_link\\\":null}]},\\\"d