kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Fpyplrl-celebrity-traitors-final-watch-party-6th-nov-big-penny-social-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Celebrity Traitors Final: Watch Party\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-06T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-06T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventRescheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Big Penny Social\",\"address\":\"1 Priestley Way, London E17 6AL, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.59085509999999,\"longitude\":-0.04131809999999999}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-14\\u002F3663e782-3569-4ac1-8c71-42c4ce918298.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"],\"description\":\"**Are you a Faithful… or a Traitor? 🕵️‍**\\n\\nJoin us at Big Penny Social for the Celebrity Traitors Final, shown on the BIG screen in our Event Space for the full experience. Your ticket includes a Traitors cocktail on the house.\\n\\nThere's a £100 bar tab up for grabs for the best costume on the night, whether you’re channelling your inner Claudia Winkleman (the darker the eyeliner, the better), a flushed Alan Carr, or don your Traitor’s cloak.\\n\\nUnreserved seating: first come, first served.\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Big Penny Social\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 Foote