\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002F3o39op-celebrity-traitors-final-live-screening-6th-nov-jujus-bar-stage-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Celebrity Traitors Final: Live Screening\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-06T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-06T23:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventRescheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"JuJu's Bar & Stage\",\"address\":\"Ely's Yard, 15 Hanbury St, London E1 6QR, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.52051280000001,\"longitude\":-0.0736106}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-11\\u002F7ea3dbf0-c0f6-451e-a6f1-79a4851553a7.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"],\"description\":\"The Traitors returns for a special celebrity edition! We'll be showing all the twists and turns of the final live on our huge screens!\\n\\nFeaturing:\\n\\n\\\\- Guaranteed seats with our 'not' round tables and sofas\\n\\n\\\\- Celia Imrie's Top Trumps\\n\\n\\\\- Claudia Winkleman lookalike contest\\n\\n\\\\- Themed cocktails: Faithful Fancys & Traitors Tipples\\n\\nLooking to make a large booking? Please email info@jujusbarandstage.com\\n\\nOver 18's Only, ID may be required.\\n\\nJuju's celebrates diversity, culture and excellence in the arts and entertainment and echoes this by providing a space to encourage equality, diversity and inclusion within our venue, and creating an environment free from unlawful discrimination.\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Juju's Bar & Stage\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Careers</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/diversity-equity-inclusion\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Diversity, equity \n&amp; inclusion</a></div></nav></details><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Fan Support<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><