.6 3.545-3.6 1.234 0 2.32.64 2.955 1.61a3.529 3.529 0 0 1 2.954-1.61c1.959 0 3.546 1.612 3.546 3.6 0 3-2.954 5.4-6.5 8.4Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Keep track of what’s coming up by saving events, sharing them with friends, or even listening to new music in the app.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17.5 19.5v.5h.5v-.5h-.5Zm-11-15V4H6v.5h.5Zm0 15H6v.5h.5v-.5Zm2-8.5H9v-1h-.5v1Zm9.5.5V11h-1v.5h1Zm-8.45-7 .49-.1-.081-.4H9.55v.5Zm0 15v.5h.409l.081-.4-.49-.1Zm4.9 0-.49.1.081.4h.409v-.5Zm4.05-15h.5V4h-.5v.5Zm-4-.5H14v1h.5V4ZM18 8.5V9h1v-.5h-1Zm-3.854-.354-.353.354.707.707.354-.353-.708-.708ZM11 6.292l.2-.458-.2.458ZM6 4.5v6h1v-6H6Zm0 6v9h1v-9H6Zm.5.5h2v-1h-2v1Zm3.05-7H6.5v1h3.05V4Zm.49 15.6A2 2 0 0 1 12 18v-1a3 3 0 0 0-2.94 2.4l.98.2ZM6.5 20h3.05v-1H6.5v1Zm5.5-2a2 2 0 0 1 1.96 1.6l.98-.2A3 3 0 0 0 12 17v1Zm2.45 2h3.05v-1h-3.05v1ZM18.5 4h-4v1h4V4Zm-.5.5v4h1v-4h-1Zm.146-.354-4 4 .708.708 4-4-.708-.708ZM12 6c-.285 0-.556-.06-.8-.166l-.4.916c.368.161.774.25 1.2.25V6Zm-.8-.166A2.005 2.005 0 0 1 10.04 4.4l-.98.198A3.004 3.004 0 0 0 10.8 6.75l.4-.916ZM18 19.5v-8h-1v8h1Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">We’ve made it easy to swap your ticket with a friend, or get a refund to a sold-out show. No stress.</p></div></div><div class=\"DownloadTheAppButtons__Buttons-sc-7487b594-0 ezoNRz\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/app/id898358948\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX gvlyjj\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15.91 2s-1.794.008-3.082 1.566h.001c-1.147 1.386-.855 2.572-.855 2.572s1.556.248 2.922-1.26C16.176 3.466 15.91 2 15.91 2Zm-2.745 4.88c-.422.156-.768.284-1.028.284-.324 0-.715-.138-1.169-.298-.63-.222-1.38-.487-2.243-.487C6.439 6.379 4 8.255 4 11.835 4 15.474 6.879 20 9.16 20c.354 0 .793-.146 1.28-.308.606-.2 1.286-.427 1.969-.427.611 0 1.142.182 1.666.362.51.175 1.014.347 1.58.347 2.496 0 4.345-4.772 4.345-4.772s-2.643-.94-2.643-3.662c0-2.416 2.122-3.412 2.122-3.412s-1.086-1.8-3.846-1.8c-.975 0-1.813.31-2.468.552Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>iOS</span></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fm.dice\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Fv3o9lg-the-holy-mountain-film-screening-the-romance-of-baba-loco-live-6th-nov-live-at-st-giles-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"The Holy Mountain: Film Screening & The Romance of Baba Loco Live\",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-06T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-06T23:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Live At St Giles\",\"address\":\"Camberwell Church Street, Southwark, London, SE5 8RB, United Kingdom\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.47364,\"longitude\":-0.08961}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-09-24\\u002Fc6395822-472d-46c8-baea-aa62a4bd061f.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1350%2C1350\"],\"description\":\"‘We began in a fairytale and we came to life, but is this life reality?’\\n\\n@dashthehengestore x SECRET CEREMONY by @lost.art.media return to church for a psychedelic quest for enlightenment. On NOVEMBER 6th we’ll be screening Alejandro Jodorowsky’s cult classic THE HOLY MOUNTAIN 🗻👁️🍄\\n\\nA surreal extravaganza featuring a cast that received intensive spiritual training and took psilocybin mushrooms, THE HOLY MOUNTAIN tracks the misadventures of a group of travellers as they ascend the Holy Mountain to dethrone the immortal gods ruling it.\\n\\nComplementing this visually spectacular story will be a performance by @theromanceofbabaloco\\n\\nOur last event was a sell-out, so grab your tickets while you can, and join us at St. Giles’ to climb the Holy Mountain this November.\\n\\n£15 early bird tickets available NOW via Dice or Ticket Tailor. Link in bio\\n\\nArt by @kieranrid\\n\\nSound as always by @evareadypa and @liveatstgiles\\n\\n\\\\--\\n\\nA percentage of every ticket sold will be contributed to The Friends of St Giles’\\n\\nThe Friends of St Giles’ was founded in the 1980’s to help raise funds for the repair and maintenance of St Giles.\\n\\nIt recognises that St Giles’ plays a significant role in the secular life of SE5, in particular through the development of community involvement in music and the arts.\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Dash The Henge Store x Secret Ceremony by LOST ART\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/jobs\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Careers</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/diversity-equity-inclusion\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">Diversity, equity \n&amp; inclusion</a></div></nav></details><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summ