IGHT \",\"startDate\":\"2025-11-16T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-16T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\",\"address\":\"1a Morocco Street, Southwark, London, SE1 3HB, United Kingdom\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.50033,\"longitude\":-0.082}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-28\\u002F87840153-7c81-4872-96c4-b13d21234b26.jpg?rect=334%2C0%2C1333%2C1333\"],\"description\":\"Got the post-London Film Festival blues? Fear not! Join us on 16th November for a cosy night of cinematic excellence at Morocco Bound Bookshop.\\n\\nWe'll be streaming a suprise film! (aka not allowed to say what film it is but the clue may or may not be in the picture)\\n\\n...All in the warmth and comfort of London's best indie bookshop and event space (based on an independent review and definitely not written by a member of staff...)\\n\\nDoors 6pm\\n\\nFilm starts 7pm\\n\\nThere will be a short break halfway through the film. Bar open all night. Lots of yummy craft beer.\\n\\nVery limited tickets, grab yours now!\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Morocco Bound\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavC