0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>London</span></span></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Container-sc-fe1abec0-0 hOlIln\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__PriceRow-sc-fe1abec0-1 bxORyQ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Price-sc-fe1abec0-6 eQzmFy\"><span>From £5</span><small>The price you&#x27;ll pay. No surprises later.</small></div><button disabled=\"\" loading=\"1\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsCallToAction__ActionButton-sc-fe1abec0-5 kmEjJP chuNsq cOKqDM\"><div class=\"Loader-sc-e02fc997-0 cGAjfq\"></div></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Container-sc-2c0d3cc1-3 gnQalZ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Title-sc-2c0d3cc1-6 gwqOGa\"><h3>Top track</h3><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__TrackTitle-sc-2c0d3cc1-4 ccdrAW\">Portishead - Glory Box</div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAWrapper-sc-2c0d3cc1-0 cnZzuM\"><audio preload=\"none\"><source src=\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/e9/12/99/e91299a5-115b-85d5-c6a5-7d7ffca699cf/mzaf_16022543165233599469.plus.aac.p.m4a\"/></audio><button class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAButton-sc-2c0d3cc1-2 kmEjJP ccUWLm eBjzPC\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 6 19 12 8.5 18V6Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Container-sc-d4710a3f-2 gzFXyG\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Text-sc-d4710a3f-1 ddUaYB\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Wrapper-sc-30f4de94-0 cEPNdr\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Truncated-sc-30f4de94-2 iyvFjU\"><p>A special screening of the pioneering Bristol trio’s celebrated concert film, filmed at New York’s Roseland Ballroom with a 28-piece orchestra. Featuring performances of the most acclaimed tracks, ‘Glory Box’, ‘Sour Times’, and ‘Roads’, from their debut an...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__MoreButton-sc-30f4de94-1 lbefHP\">Read more</button></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlights-sc-d40475af-2 dXmIOz\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.5 10.5H12v5m-1.5 0H12m0 0h1.5m-1.5-7V8m7.5 4a7.5 7.5 0 1 1-15 0 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0Z\"></path></svg><div><span>This is an 18+ event</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 14.5h-3v-5h5m-2 5v4m0-4h2m0 0 7 4v-13l-7 4m0 5v-5m9 1v3\"></path></svg><div><span>Presented by Deeper Into Movies.</span><small></small></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 EventDetailsBase__RefundPolicyHighlight-sc-d40475af-1 dVKeAb hDpyKl\"><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__CurrencyIconWrapper-sc-d4710a3f-0 uUSAl\"><div class=\"CurrencyIcon__Currency-sc-8c04e303-0 jMba-DY\">£</div></div><div><span>You can <a href=\"https://dice.fm/help/article?id=4409603669777\" target=\"_blank\">get a refund</a> if:</span><ul><li>It’s within 24 hours of buying tickets</li><li>This event is rescheduled or cancelled</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__Highlight-sc-d40475af-0 dVKeAb\">You can&#x27;t get a refund within 24 hours of the ev