een_feature_2\":\"You’ll have a brief window to buy them\",\"waiting_list_confirmation_screen_feature_3\":\"If you miss your chance, rejoin at the top\",\"waiting_list_confirmation_screen_feature_3_v2\":\"Turn on your notifications to make sure you hear\\u2028about available tickets in time\",\"waiting_list_confirmation_screen_feature_4\":\"You can change the number of tickets you want\",\"waiting_list_confirmation_screen_title\":\"You’re on the wait list,\\nnow you need the app\",\"waiting_list_confirmation_screen_title_v2\":\"You’re on the wait list, \\nnow get the app\"},\"tags\":{\"tags_hierarchy\":{\"culture_art\":\"Art\",\"culture_comedy\":\"Comedy\",\"culture_film\":\"Film\",\"culture_podcast\":\"Podcast\",\"culture_social\":\"Social\",\"culture_sport\":\"Sport\",\"culture_talks\":\"Talk\",\"culture_theatre\":\"Theatre\",\"culture_wellbeing\":\"Wellbeing\",\"culture_workshop\":\"Workshop\",\"music_artistsigning\":\"Artist signing\",\"music_dj\":\"DJ\",\"music_gig\":\"Gigs\",\"music_party\":\"Party\",\"music_playback\":\"Playback\"}}}},\"initialLanguage\":\"en\",\"i18nServerInstance\":null,\"pageProps\":{\"headerProps\":{\"theme\":\"dark\",\"disableAutoHide\":true},\"loaded\":true,\"statusCode\":200,\"initialState\":\"{\\\"auth\\\":{\\\"isValidating\\\":true,\\\"isRestored\\\":false,\\\"isNewUser\\\":false},\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"flow\\\":{\\\"loading\\\":false,\\\"channel\\\":\\\"email\\\",\\\"availableChannels\\\":[]},\\\"artists\\\":{},\\\"promoters\\\":{},\\\"tickets\\\":{\\\"isLoading\\\":false},\\\"event\\\":{\\\"event\\\":{\\\"seats_io_event_id\\\":null,\\\"about\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"Christiane F., Kai Hermann’s biography of a teen junkie and sex worker, caused a scandal on publication. As a recovering cocaine addict and father Bowie was shocked at witnessing teenagers getting their smack money from pick-ups at Berlin Zoo and so became interested in this film adaptation. Within the film, Bowie’s live show, tonally perfect Station to Station-