ot a code?</a></div></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__Content-sc-e27c8822-3 iLVFSu\"><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Container-sc-cac69206-5 jisTAL\"><h1 class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Title-sc-cac69206-0 duXLSp\">The Holiday Drink-Along Movie Night </h1><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Venues-sc-cac69206-1 iqTKlf\"><a href=\"/venue/the-clapham-grand-ry8v\">The Clapham Grand</a></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Date-sc-cac69206-2 kDgXil\">Thu, 11 Dec, 6:30 pm</div><div class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tags-sc-cac69206-4 cfoWLz\"><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"m13.5 19.5-8-8v-6h6l8 8-6 6Z\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M9 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3Z\"></path></svg><span>Film</span></span><span class=\"EventDetailsTitle__Tag-sc-cac69206-3 hFGqZr\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M10.774 18.763c.262.283.48.509.634.664.194.196.393.385.592.576.199-.19.398-.38.592-.576a30.327 30.327 0 0 0 2.557-2.957c.7-.927 1.407-1.993 1.941-3.094.532-1.095.91-2.26.91-3.376a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 1.116.378 2.28.91 3.376.534 1.101 1.242 2.167 1.94 3.094.701.928 1.4 1.727 1.924 2.293ZM12 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>London</span></span></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Container-sc-fe1abec0-0 hOlIln\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__PriceRow-sc-fe1abec0-1 bxORyQ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsCallToAction__Price-sc-fe1abec0-6 eQzmFy\"><span>From £10</span><small>The price you&#x27;ll pay. No surprises later.</small></div><button disabled=\"\" loading=\"1\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsCallToAction__ActionButton-sc-fe1abec0-5 kmEjJP chuNsq cOKqDM\"><div class=\"Loader-sc-e02fc997-0 cGAjfq\"></div></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Container-sc-2c0d3cc1-3 gnQalZ\"><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__Title-sc-2c0d3cc1-6 gwqOGa\"><h3>Top track</h3><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__TrackTitle-sc-2c0d3cc1-4 ccdrAW\">The Killers - Mr. Brightside</div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAWrapper-sc-2c0d3cc1-0 cnZzuM\"><audio preload=\"none\"><source src=\"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/5c/95/cf/5c95cf3a-bef3-97e7-b6aa-3adde55deb30/mzaf_15328769143459778457.plus.aac.p.m4a\"/></audio><button class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 EventDetailsTopTrack__CTAButton-sc-2c0d3cc1-2 kmEjJP ccUWLm eBjzPC\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 6 19 12 8.5 18V6Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsGotCode__Container-sc-2d693cc1-0 ebDKho\"><a>Got a code?</a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Container-sc-d4710a3f-2 gzFXyG\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"EventDetailsAbout__Text-sc-d4710a3f-1 ddUaYB\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Wrapper-sc-30f4de94-0 cEPNdr\"><div class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__Truncated-sc-30f4de94-2 iyvFjU\"><p><strong>DOORS: 6.30PM / PRE-SHOW &amp; GAMES: 7.15PM / MOVIE 7.30PM</strong></p>\n<p>What better way to kick start the holiday season than The Holiday Drink-A-Long Movie Night (&amp; seeing Cameron Diaz run towards the sexy, glasses wearing DILF, Jude Law, through the snow in her heels!)...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"TruncatedMarkdown__MoreButton-sc-30f4de94-1 lbefHP\">