ice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Frybnxw-the-holiday-drink-along-movie-night-11th-dec-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"The Holiday Drink-Along Movie Night \",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-11T18:30:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-11T22:30:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.4629923,\"longitude\":-0.169368800000029}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-07\\u002Fe42a5e2f-229a-4c1c-aa7f-4e962d1a3895.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"],\"description\":\"**DOORS: 6.30PM \\u002F PRE-SHOW & GAMES: 7.15PM \\u002F MOVIE 7.30PM**\\n\\nWhat better way to kick start the holiday season than The Holiday Drink-A-Long Movie Night (& seeing Cameron Diaz run towards the sexy, glasses wearing DILF, Jude Law, through the snow in her heels!)\\n\\nWe will have Pigs in blankets, mulled wine, mince pies and of course blankets for the cold and old for that christmassy cosy feeling! Even Kate Winslet will be there! Okay maybe not there physically but, in spirit and cardboard form for sure! It's a night of love, Christmas cheer and drinking until we all dance like we're in a remote cottage screaming the words to Mr Brightside!\\n\\nExpect:\\n\\n- The movie on our massive screen 📺\\n- Snow machines, confetti & balloon drops ❄️\\n- Live host & show team 🕺\\n- Singalong carols, games & dance-offs 🎄\\n- Prizes for best costumes 🏆\\n- The Grand’s cocktails & mulled wine 🍷\\n- Pigs in blankets, hotdogs & nachos, courtesy of Hot Beige (yes, veganny goodness too!) 🐷\\n- Popcorn for £3 🍿\\n\\nOur Christmas Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching the movie uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before & after the film, including The Grand's live hosts & show team, mulled wine, mince pies, confetti, snow machines, the occasional balloon drop 🎈\\n\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off! Super Important Movie Night Deets:\\n\\n**TICKETS** 🎟 For any ticketing queries please visit the DICE Help Centre\\n\\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS** 😉 We are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might not be!\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE<