.954-1.61c1.959 0 3.546 1.612 3.546 3.6 0 3-2.954 5.4-6.5 8.4Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Keep track of what’s coming up by saving events, sharing them with friends, or even listening to new music in the app.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17.5 19.5v.5h.5v-.5h-.5Zm-11-15V4H6v.5h.5Zm0 15H6v.5h.5v-.5Zm2-8.5H9v-1h-.5v1Zm9.5.5V11h-1v.5h1Zm-8.45-7 .49-.1-.081-.4H9.55v.5Zm0 15v.5h.409l.081-.4-.49-.1Zm4.9 0-.49.1.081.4h.409v-.5Zm4.05-15h.5V4h-.5v.5Zm-4-.5H14v1h.5V4ZM18 8.5V9h1v-.5h-1Zm-3.854-.354-.353.354.707.707.354-.353-.708-.708ZM11 6.292l.2-.458-.2.458ZM6 4.5v6h1v-6H6Zm0 6v9h1v-9H6Zm.5.5h2v-1h-2v1Zm3.05-7H6.5v1h3.05V4Zm.49 15.6A2 2 0 0 1 12 18v-1a3 3 0 0 0-2.94 2.4l.98.2ZM6.5 20h3.05v-1H6.5v1Zm5.5-2a2 2 0 0 1 1.96 1.6l.98-.2A3 3 0 0 0 12 17v1Zm2.45 2h3.05v-1h-3.05v1ZM18.5 4h-4v1h4V4Zm-.5.5v4h1v-4h-1Zm.146-.354-4 4 .708.708 4-4-.708-.708ZM12 6c-.285 0-.556-.06-.8-.166l-.4.916c.368.161.774.25 1.2.25V6Zm-.8-.166A2.005 2.005 0 0 1 10.04 4.4l-.98.198A3.004 3.004 0 0 0 10.8 6.75l.4-.916ZM18 19.5v-8h-1v8h1Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">We’ve made it easy to swap your ticket with a friend, or get a refund to a sold-out show. No stress.</p></div></div><div class=\"DownloadTheAppButtons__Buttons-sc-7487b594-0 ezoNRz\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/app/id898358948\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX gvlyjj\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15.91 2s-1.794.008-3.082 1.566h.001c-1.147 1.386-.855 2.572-.855 2.572s1.556.248 2.922-1.26C16.176 3.466 15.91 2 15.91 2Zm-2.745 4.88c-.422.156-.768.284-1.028.284-.324 0-.715-.138-1.169-.298-.63-.222-1.38-.487-2.243-.487C6.439 6.379 4 8.255 4 11.835 4 15.474 6.879 20 9.16 20c.354 0 .793-.146 1.28-.308.606-.2 1.286-.427 1.969-.427.611 0 1.142.182 1.666.362.51.175 1.014.347 1.58.347 2.496 0 4.345-4.772 4.345-4.772s-2.643-.94-2.643-3.662c0-2.416 2.122-3.412 2.122-3.412s-1.086-1.8-3.846-1.8c-.975 0-1.813.31-2.468.552Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>iOS</span></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fm.dice\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p><p class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__NoSmartphone-sc-7130cefd-0 dbVqMc\">No smartphone? No worries, check our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/articles/19414143889169-How-to-access-your-tickets-if-you-can-t-get-on-the-app\">FAQs</a></p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Fbby3wk-love-actually-drink-along-movie-night-xmas-disco-13th-dec-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Love Actually Drink-Along Movie Night & Xmas Disco\",\"startDate\":\"2025-12-13T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-13T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventScheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.4629923,\"longitude\":-0.169368800000029}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-09-23\\u002Faeab81da-a9b9-4a3f-a787-548b9ad0941d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1200%2C1200\"],\"description\":\"**DOORS: 6PM \\u002F LIVE SHOW & GAMES: 7PM \\u002F MOVIE 7.15PM \\u002F XMAS DISCO AFTER PARTY 9:15PM**\\n\\n“If you look for it, we’ve got a sneaky feeling you’ll find that Love, Christmas and Drinking are all around us…” Even if you do have to try and squeeze an extra syllables to make it work 😂\\n\\nOur Love Actually Movie Nights are legendary! We’ll be bringing back our world famous ‘Ant or Dec’ competition, the prosecco-tastic drink-along, prizes for best fancy dress, all the Lobster Octopus outfits, countless crowdsurfing Hugh Grant cardboard cut outs, a cheeky mini xmas disco & the movie on our ENORMOUS screen! 🎬\\n\\nExpect:\\n\\nThe movie on our massive screen 📺\\n\\nSnow machines, confetti & balloon drops ❄️\\n\\nLive host & show team 🕺\\n\\nSingalong carols, games & dance-offs 🎄\\n\\nPrizes for best costumes 🏆\\n\\nThe Grand’s cocktails & mulled wine 🍷\\n\\nPigs in blankets, hotdogs & nachos, courtesy of Hot Beige (yes, veganny goodness too!) 🐷\\n\\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\\n\\nOur Christmas Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching the movie uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before & after the film, including The Grand's live hosts & show team, mulled wine, mince pies, confetti, snow machines, the occasional balloon drop 🎈\\n\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off! Super Important Movie Night Deets:\\n\\n**TICKETS** 🎟 For any ticketing queries please visit the DICE Help Centre\\n\\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS** 😉 We are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might not be!\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\