ab81da-a9b9-4a3f-a787-548b9ad0941d.jpg?rect=270%2C0%2C660%2C1200\\\"},\\\"attendance_type\\\":\\\"live_only\\\",\\\"perm_name\\\":\\\"bby3wk-love-actually-drink-along-movie-night-xmas-disco-13th-dec-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\\\",\\\"social_links\\\":{\\\"event_share\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/O7bec1963ed8?dice_id=O7bec1963ed8\\\",\\\"post_competition_referral\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/F640b8777b7c?dice_id=F640b8777b7c\\\",\\\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/Oc7da4508adc?dice_id=Oc7da4508adc\\\",\\\"post_purchase_referral\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/J46070505913?dice_id=J46070505913\\\",\\\"post_reminder_referral\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/Rd8b491f6017?dice_id=Rd8b491f6017\\\",\\\"post_waitinglist_referral\\\":\\\"https://link.dice.fm/Ra0fd7ace850?dice_id=Ra0fd7ace850\\\"},\\\"is_fully_locked\\\":false,\\\"seats_io_event_id\\\":null,\\\"max_tickets\\\":12,\\\"seats_io_public_key\\\":null,\\\"streaming_options\\\":null,\\\"public_refund_policy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"cooling_off_enabled\\\",\\\"hours\\\":24},\\\"status\\\":\\\"on-sale\\\",\\\"marketeers\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Clapham Grand\\\",\\\"privacy_policy_link\\\":\\\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\\\",\\\"fb_pixel_id\\\":\\\"1705644923004016\\\",\\\"ga_tracking_id\\\":\\\"UA-5134978-1\\\",\\\"tiktok_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"google_ads_conversion_id\\\":null,\\\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\\\":null,\\\"show_web_opt_in_form\\\":true,\\\"show_opt_in_form\\\":true,\\\"opt_out_as_default\\\":false}],\\\"announcement_date_unix\\\":1758542400,\\\"billing_promoter\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"399\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Clapham Grand\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":null},\\\"perm_name\\\":\\\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\\\",\\\"profile_active\\\":false},\\\"previews\\\":[],\\\"date_unix\\\":1765648800,\\\"secondary_status\\\":null,\\\"about\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"**DOORS: 6PM / LIVE SHOW \\u0026 GAMES: 7PM / MOVIE 7.15PM / XMAS DISCO AFTER PARTY 9:15PM**\\\\n\\\\n“If you look for it, we’ve got a sneaky feeling you’ll find that Love, Christmas and Drinking are all around us…” Even if you do have to try and squeeze an extra syllables to make it work 😂\\\\n\\\\nOur Love Actually Movie Nights are legendary! We’ll be bringing back our world famous ‘Ant or Dec’ competition, the prosecco-tastic drink-along, prizes for best fancy dress, all the Lobster Octopus outfits, countless crowdsurfing Hugh Grant cardboard cut outs, a cheeky mini xmas disco \\u0026 the movie on our ENORMOUS screen! 🎬\\\\n\\\\nExpect:\\\\n\\\\nThe movie on our massive screen 📺\\\\n\\\\nSnow machines, confetti \\u0026 balloon drops ❄️\\\\n\\\\nLive host \\u0026 show team 🕺\\\\n\\\\nSingalong carols, games \\u0026 dance-offs 🎄\\\\n\\\\nPrizes for best costumes 🏆\\\\n\\\\nThe Grand’s cocktails \\u0026 mulled wine 🍷\\\\n\\\\nPigs in blankets, hotdogs \\u0026 nachos, courtesy of Hot Beige (yes, veganny goodness too!) 🐷\\\\n\\\\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\\\\n\\\\nOur Christmas Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching the movie uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before \\u0026 after the film, including The Grand's live hosts \\u0026 show team, mulled wine, mince pies, confetti, snow machines, the occasional balloon drop 🎈\\\\n\\\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar \\u0026 food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off! Super Important Movie Night Deets:\\\\n\\\\n**TICKETS** 🎟 For any ticketing queries please visit the DICE Help Centre\\\\n\\\\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS** 😉 We are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might no