.633-.333.971-.433.153-.048.285-.122.428-.18.337-.158.686-.312 1.04-.465Z\"></path></g><defs><clipPath id=\"dice-app_svg__a\"><path fill=\"#fff\" d=\"M20 9h57v78H20z\"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><h2 class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeaturesHeader-sc-b39de8c0-3 jgomaf\">Download the DICE app</h2><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 cHOsYM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M8.5 17.5a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0Zm0 0V10m9 4.5a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0Zm0 0V7m-9 3V7.5l9-3V7m-9 3 9-3\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Discover the best nights out in your city, with tailored recommendations synced to your music library.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 18.5c-3.545-3-6.5-5.4-6.5-8.4 0-1.988 1.587-3.6 3.545-3.6 1.234 0 2.32.64 2.955 1.61a3.529 3.529 0 0 1 2.954-1.61c1.959 0 3.546 1.612 3.546 3.6 0 3-2.954 5.4-6.5 8.4Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">Keep track of what’s coming up by saving events, sharing them with friends, or even listening to new music in the app.</p></div><div class=\"DownloadTheApp__Feature-sc-b39de8c0-4 kONEbp\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M17.5 19.5v.5h.5v-.5h-.5Zm-11-15V4H6v.5h.5Zm0 15H6v.5h.5v-.5Zm2-8.5H9v-1h-.5v1Zm9.5.5V11h-1v.5h1Zm-8.45-7 .49-.1-.081-.4H9.55v.5Zm0 15v.5h.409l.081-.4-.49-.1Zm4.9 0-.49.1.081.4h.409v-.5Zm4.05-15h.5V4h-.5v.5Zm-4-.5H14v1h.5V4ZM18 8.5V9h1v-.5h-1Zm-3.854-.354-.353.354.707.707.354-.353-.708-.708ZM11 6.292l.2-.458-.2.458ZM6 4.5v6h1v-6H6Zm0 6v9h1v-9H6Zm.5.5h2v-1h-2v1Zm3.05-7H6.5v1h3.05V4Zm.49 15.6A2 2 0 0 1 12 18v-1a3 3 0 0 0-2.94 2.4l.98.2ZM6.5 20h3.05v-1H6.5v1Zm5.5-2a2 2 0 0 1 1.96 1.6l.98-.2A3 3 0 0 0 12 17v1Zm2.45 2h3.05v-1h-3.05v1ZM18.5 4h-4v1h4V4Zm-.5.5v4h1v-4h-1Zm.146-.354-4 4 .708.708 4-4-.708-.708ZM12 6c-.285 0-.556-.06-.8-.166l-.4.916c.368.161.774.25 1.2.25V6Zm-.8-.166A2.005 2.005 0 0 1 10.04 4.4l-.98.198A3.004 3.004 0 0 0 10.8 6.75l.4-.916ZM18 19.5v-8h-1v8h1Z\"></path></svg><p class=\"DownloadTheApp__FeatureText-sc-b39de8c0-5 edRuhS\">We’ve made it easy to swap your ticket with a friend, or get a refund to a sold-out show. No stress.</p></div></div><div class=\"DownloadTheAppButtons__Buttons-sc-7487b594-0 ezoNRz\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/app/id898358948\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX gvlyjj\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15.91 2s-1.794.008-3.082 1.566h.001c-1.147 1.386-.855 2.572-.855 2.572s1.556.248 2.922-1.26C16.176 3.466 15.91 2 15.91 2Zm-2.745 4.88c-.422.156-.768.284-1.028.284-.324 0-.715-.138-1.169-.298-.63-.222-1.38-.487-2.243-.487C6.439 6.379 4 8.255 4 11.835 4 15.474 6.879 20 9.16 20c.354 0 .793-.146 1.28-.308.606-.2 1.286-.427 1.969-.427.611 0 1.142.182 1.666.362.51.175 1.014.347 1.58.347 2.496 0 4.345-4.772 4.345-4.772s-2.643-.94-2.643-3.662c0-2.416 2.122-3.412 2.122-3.412s-1.086-1.8-3.846-1.8c-.975 0-1.813.31-2.468.552Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>iOS</span></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fm.dice\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ButtonBase-sc-85d4fc6-0 Button-sc-2202b5a-0 DownloadTheAppButtons__DownloadSpecific-sc-7487b594-3 kmEjJP heaINX eZhFUz\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM18 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-4ZM7 10h10v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2h-2v2a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-2H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-7Z\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.776 2.553a.5.5 0 0 1 .671.223l.775 1.55A4.99 4.99 0 0 1 12 4a4.99 4.99 0 0 1 1.778.325l.775-1.549a.5.5 0 1 1 .894.448l-.775 1.55A4.996 4.996 0 0 1 17 9H7c0-1.779.929-3.34 2.328-4.227l-.775-1.55a.5.5 0 0 1 .223-.67ZM10 6.5a.5.5 0 1 1-1 0 .5.5 0 0 1 1 0Zm4.5.5a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Android</span></a></div></div><div class=\"EventDetailsLayout__MobileContent-sc-e27c8822-5 gpcchb\"><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div><div class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__Container-sc-7130cefd-1 kjqLCB\"><p>DICE protects fans and artists from touts. Tickets will be securely stored in the app.</p><p class=\"EventDetailsFAQ__NoSmartphone-sc-7130cefd-0 dbVqMc\">No smartphone? No worries, check our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://dicefm.zendesk.com/hc/articles/19414143889169-How-to-access-your-tickets-if-you-can-t-get-on-the-app\">FAQs</a></p></div><div class=\"EventDetailsBase__HR-sc-d40475af-3 eSgOkc\"></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"ScreeningEvent\",\"url\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fevent\\u002Feodx2w-labyrinth-movie-night-and-a-bowie-disco-9th-jan-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"name\":\"Labyrinth Movie Night and A Bowie Disco!\",\"startDate\":\"2026-01-09T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-09T22:30:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FOfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\\u002FEventRescheduled\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":51.4629923,\"longitude\":-0.169368800000029}},\"image\":[\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fdice-media.imgix.net\\u002Fattachments\\u002F2025-10-27\\u002F3a8ce5b5-f975-48a1-8da7-24b4cb021bb2.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"],\"description\":\"**Join our fabulous, annual, Labyrinth Movie Night on Fri 9th January 2026!**\\n\\n**DOORS: 6PM**  \\n**SHOW: 7PM**  \\n**MOVIE: 7:30PM**  \\n**CURFEW: 10:30PM**\\n\\nCome join us, Jareth, Hoggle, Ludo, Sarah & the gang deep inside Jim Henson cult classic Labyrinth on our MASSIVE SCREEN alongside all our Movie Night magic 🎬 ...\\\"You remind me of the babe……” 🔮\\n\\nWe’ll be bringing back our world famous Dance Magic Dance-Off, there’s prizes for the best fancy dress in the Goblin King Costume Parade, free Star Man make up Make Overs, Themed Cocktails (bog of eternal stench fish bowl anyone...) and we will finish the evening with a Mini Bowie Disco of your fave Bowie classics other 70s & 80s bangers! What better way to celebrate what would be the great man’s Birthday Weekend! 🎂\\n\\nExpect:\\n\\n- Movie on our massive 25ft screen 📺\\n- Our Dreamteam show hosts and dancers ⚡️\\n- Dance magic dance-offs 💃\\n- Goblin King costume comp 🥇\\n- The Grand’s themed cocktails 🍹\\n- Hotdogs & nachos courtesy of Hot Beige (Vegan goodness, too) 🌭\\n- Popcorn for £3 🍿\\n\\nOur Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching Labyrinth uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) HD Screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before & after the film, including The Grand’s Dreamteam hosts & show team, all the confetti, games and even the occasional balloon drop. 🎈\\n\\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!\\n\\n**Super Important Movie Night Deets:**\\n\\n**TICKETS 🎟**\\n\\nFor any ticketing queries please contact http:\\u002F\\u002Fdice.fm\\u002Fcontact\\n\\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS 😉**\\n\\nWe are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18’s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might not be!\\n\\n**TIMES ⏰**\\n\\nDoors at 6:30pm and the fun starts about 7.30pm, we advise arrival before 7pm so give you time to be seated by our ushers and grab food and drink from the bars. The movie will start around 8pm, and there is a cheeky Bowie disco until about 12am.\\n\\n**SEATING 🪑**\\n\\nStalls & Circle seating is unreserved and allocated on a first come first served basis across these areas. Upper Circle seating is allocated first come first served basis across this area. There are as many seats as there are tickets sold so please don’t panic about getting one\\n\\n**ROYAL BOXES & TABLES 👑**\\n\\nRoyal Boxes & Tables will be reserved for you, and we hold them all until an hour after doors open. Please notify us in advance if you’re running late as we will offer to other customers once the movie starts.\\n\\n**SUBTITLES 👀**\\n\\nWe aim to make our Movie Nights an enjoyable experience for everyone, and will show our Movie’s with subtitles on if requested by any hard of hearing customers, please email us if this is required info@claphamgrand.com\\n\\n**ACCESSIBILITY TICKETS 📧**\\n\\nFor any accessibility requirements or tickets, please contact info@claphamgrand.com, where you shall receive a code to access and pay for your tickets. (availability depending)\\n\\n**VENUE ACCESSIBILITY ♿️**\\n\\nFor any accessibility assistance coming to our venue, please don’t hesitate to contact us in advance so we can make sure we can facilitate this: info@claphamgrand.com. We have a fully wheelchair accessible toilet, located in our gender neutral bathroom in the stalls, and we have step free access into the stalls.\\n\\n**CLOAKROOM 🧥**\\n\\nWe have a cloakroom here, which was voted in the top 5 cloakrooms in the UK for the last 10 years, and it’s £2.50 an item.\\n\\n**PARKING \\u002F GETTING HERE 🚂 🚗 🚌**\\n\\nWe don’t have any parking at venue (these Victorians only had horses and carts), but we are directly opposite Clapham Junction, (Europes busiest train station!) and there are parking spaces available there from www.justpark.com and we are on so many bus routes!\\n\\n**FAQ'S ❓**\\n\\nFor any other questions, please refer to FAQ page – https:\\u002F\\u002Fclaphamgrand.com\\u002Ffaqs\\n\\n**SPECIAL EFFECTS WARNING 🎉 🎈🚥 ⚠️**\\n\\nPlease note there will be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us via info@claphamgrand.com – we want to make sure you have a safe experience with us!\",\"offers\":[],\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\"}}</script></div><footer class=\"Footer__Wrapper-sc-b4b03d95-1 bXotkg default-footer-background hide-in-purchase-flow\"><div class=\"Footer__MaxWidthWrapper-sc-b4b03d95-2 Footer__PrimaryFooter-sc-b4b03d95-3 ZGZWE btQVbq\"><div class=\"Footer__LogoCol-sc-b4b03d95-6 fGSCng\"><a aria-label=\"DICE\" href=\"/\" class=\"Footer__Logo-sc-b4b03d95-7 ebGIam\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"244\" alt=\"DICE\" src=\"/static/images/dice-fan.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></div><div class=\"Footer__Nav-sc-b4b03d95-8 kTXnAq\"><details open=\"\" class=\"FooterNavCol-sc-e5ef781b-0 jLkSXP\"><summary class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__NavTitle-sc-e5ef781b-2 irmwOP dsHsU\">Our company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"FooterNavCol__NavIcon-sc-e5ef781b-1 iFhQbp\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" d=\"M17.5 9.5 12 15 6.5 9.5\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"FooterNavCol__NavList-sc-e5ef781b-3 cFQaLH\"><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"Description-sc-f5e05090-0 FooterNavCol__FooterLink-sc-e5ef781b-5 irmwOP hHfdJX\">About DICE</a></div><div class=\"FooterNavCol__NavItem-sc-e5ef781b-4 jZpIza\"><