s\\\":12,\\\"seats_io_public_key\\\":null,\\\"streaming_options\\\":null,\\\"public_refund_policy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"cooling_off_enabled\\\",\\\"hours\\\":24},\\\"status\\\":\\\"on-sale\\\",\\\"marketeers\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Clapham Grand\\\",\\\"privacy_policy_link\\\":\\\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\\\",\\\"fb_pixel_id\\\":\\\"1705644923004016\\\",\\\"ga_tracking_id\\\":\\\"UA-5134978-1\\\",\\\"tiktok_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\\\":null,\\\"google_ads_conversion_id\\\":null,\\\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\\\":null,\\\"show_web_opt_in_form\\\":true,\\\"show_opt_in_form\\\":true,\\\"opt_out_as_default\\\":false}],\\\"announcement_date_unix\\\":1755100800,\\\"billing_promoter\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"399\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Clapham Grand\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"url\\\":null},\\\"perm_name\\\":\\\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\\\",\\\"profile_active\\\":false},\\\"previews\\\":[],\\\"date_unix\\\":1768649400,\\\"secondary_status\\\":null,\\\"about\\\":{\\\"description\\\":\\\"**Enjoy High School Musical 3 as we bring this cult classic back for one day only, on Sat 17th January 2026 🌟**\\\\n\\\\nThey went viral on TikTok last year and over 4,500 Disney Channel lovers have already come to party with us before… So, gather your fellow Wild Cats for:\\\\n\\\\nAn hour of bottomless booze 🍾  \\\\nThe whole movie on our big-ass screen! 📽️  \\\\nWe’re All In This Together mass sing-a-longs🎙️  \\\\nDisney Channel Mini Disco 🕺  \\\\nShow stopping performances from our Wild Cat Dreamteam 🤩  \\\\nPrizes for the Best Costumes 👗  \\\\nGet’cha Head in the Game Competition 🏆  \\\\nHotdogs \\u0026 Nachos courtesy of Hot Beige, even vegan goodness too! 🌭  \\\\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\\\\n\\\\n**IMPORTANT INFO:**\\\\n\\\\nDoors: 12PM  \\\\nBottomless hour: 12:30-1:30PM  \\\\nMovie, Show, Games: 1-3:30PM  \\\\nMini Disney Disco: until close at 4:15PM  \\\\nLas